        "name": "Battlefield 3: Premium Edition",
        "summary": "Take your Battlefield 3 multiplayer experience to the next level with Battlefield 3: Premium Edition! Containing a staggering amount of content, Battlefield 3 Premium offers all expansion packs with early access, new soldier and weapon camos, and a number of exclusive in-game items all for a one-time fee. Battlefield 3: Premium Edition includes expansion packs Back to Karkand, Close Quarters, Armored Kill, End Game, and Expansion Pack #5.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/coaoaj.jpg",
